-- **Dismissals follow the chain of copies** (`extendedDismissals`): a task deleted from a week stays deleted there as its source becomes a copy of a copy week by week (any source task whose `carriedFrom`/`repeatsFrom` links lead back to a dismissed task is dismissed too). A carried or repeating task already copied into another card of the week (renamed, with a new card taking the old name) isn't copied again. A repeating list's checks came with it, so they don't keep an otherwise untouched copy when its source goes. Sync's own saves (`save(keepsUndo: true)`) don't end a delete's Undo. Week-start changes forget preview IDs (`lastPreviews`), and a preview never takes a saved week's ID.
